ate run length 2. So y_n = x_{n-1}.\n\nThus recurrence:\n\nx_n = x_{n-1} + y_{n-1}\ny_n = x_{n-1}\n\nWe can compute total T_n = x_n + y_n.\n\nWe can derive recurrence for T_n:\n\nT_n = x_n + y_n = (x_{n-1} + y_{n-1}) + x_{n-1} = 2 x_{n-1} + y_{n-1} = 2 x_{n-1} + (T_{n-1} - x_{n-1}) = x_{n-1} + T_{n-1}.\n\nBut x_{n-1} = T_{n-2} (since x_{n-1} = T_{n-2} from earlier? Let's compute: x_{n-1} = T_{n-2} because x_{n-1} = x_{n-2} + y_{n-2} = T_{n-2}. Yes.)\n\nSo T_n = T_{n-1} + T_{n-2}.\n\nThus T_n follows Fibonacci-like recurrence with T_"}}],"created":1790984041,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":3713,"total_tokens":4481,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-CvhbqrmahqbFRk9LEbab6QZM9oD1YSba","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":3713,"prompt_ms":460.087,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12391246970105035,"prompt_per_second":8070.212807577697,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2367.431,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.08661147327249,"predicted_per_second":323.9798752318441}}